# Goldens are committed. *.txt and *.log above are globally ignored, so goldens
# must stay .v / .json; *.lef and *.gds are ignored too, which is why the test
# suite asserts on derived LEF numbers (pin counts, stub list, SIZE) rather than
# committing a golden LEF that would churn on every layout change.
!tests/golden/*.v
